---
if (!import.meta.env.DEV) return Astro.redirect('/404');

const metadata = {
  title: 'Services — Root Branch Learning Studio',
  ignoreTitleTemplate: true,
};
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>{metadata.title}</title>
    <style>
      * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      body { font-family: 'Georgia', serif; background: #ffffff; color: #1a1a1a; }
      nav {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 1.5rem 3rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
      }
      nav .logo {
        font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        font-weight: normal;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        color: #1a1a1a;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      nav .logo span { color: #2563eb; }
      nav ul { list-style: none; display: flex; gap: 2rem; }
      nav ul a {
        text-decoration: none;
        color: #444;
        font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.03em;
      }
      nav ul a:hover { color: #2563eb; }
      .page-header {
        max-width: 860px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 5rem 2rem 3rem;
      }
      .eyebrow {
        font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #2563eb;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }
      .page-header h1 {
        font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
        font-weight: normal;
        color: #111;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }
      .page-header p {
        font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
        font-size: 1rem;
        color: #666;
        line-height: 1.75;
        max-width: 580px;
      }
      .services {
        max-width: 860px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 3rem 2rem 6rem;
      }
      .service {
        border-top: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
        padding: 2.5rem 0;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;
        gap: 3rem;
      }
      @media (max-width: 640px) { .service { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1rem; } }
      .service-label {
        font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #999;
        padding-top: 0.25rem;
      }
      .service-content h2 {
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        font-weight: normal;
        color: #111;
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      }
      .service-content p {
        font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.92rem;
        color: #666;
        line-height: 1.75;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }
      .service-tags {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.5rem;
      }
      .tag {
        font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        color: #2563eb;
        border: 1px solid #c7d9fb;
        padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
        background: #f0f5ff;
      }
      .cta-band {
        background: #111;
        color: #fff;
        padding: 5rem 2rem;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .cta-band h2 {
        font-size: 1.8rem;
        font-weight: normal;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }
      .cta-band p {
        font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        color: #aaa;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
      }
      .btn-primary {
        background: #2563eb;
        color: #fff;
        padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
        font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      footer {
        border-top: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
        padding: 2rem 3rem;
        font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        color: #999;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <nav>
      <a href="/agency" class="logo">Root Branch <span>Learning Studio</span></a>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/agency/services">Services</a></li>
        <li><a href="/agency/case-studies">Work</a></li>
        <li><a href="/agency/work-with-us">Work With Us</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <div class="page-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">What We Build</p>
      <h1>Services</h1>
      <p>We design and develop technical learning experiences across four core practice areas. All engagements are project-based and delivered through Root Branch Learning Studio LLC.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="services">
      <div class="service">
        <div class="service-label">01</div>
        <div class="service-content">
          <h2>eLearning Development</h2>
          <p>Custom Articulate Storyline 360 and Rise 360 courses built to your learning objectives. We handle everything from storyboarding to SCORM packaging — including custom JavaScript interactions, branching scenarios, and consequence-driven simulations that go beyond template-level work.</p>
          <div class="service-tags">
            <span class="tag">Articulate Storyline 360</span>
            <span class="tag">Rise 360</span>
            <span class="tag">Custom JavaScript</span>
            <span class="tag">SCORM / xAPI</span>
            <span class="tag">Branching Scenarios</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service">
        <div class="service-label">02</div>
        <div class="service-content">
          <h2>Technical Training for Developer Audiences</h2>
          <p>Onboarding, platform adoption, and upskilling curriculum designed specifically for software engineers and technical users. We've taught full-stack development and built AI-assisted developer curriculum — we understand how developers learn and what makes technical training actually stick.</p>
          <div class="service-tags">
            <span class="tag">Developer Onboarding</span>
            <span class="tag">Platform Adoption</span>
            <span class="tag">Hands-on Labs</span>
            <span class="tag">AI-Assisted Development</span>
            <span class="tag">Technical Documentation</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service">
        <div class="service-label">03</div>
        <div class="service-content">
          <h2>AI-Native Curriculum Design</h2>
          <p>End-to-end curriculum development using an AI-assisted production pipeline — Claude, Gemini, and NotebookLM integrated at every stage to synthesize SME content, generate practice scenarios, QA modules, and maintain consistency across iterative release cycles. Faster production without sacrificing instructional quality.</p>
          <div class="service-tags">
            <span class="tag">AI Workflow Integration</span>
            <span class="tag">Rapid Development</span>
            <span class="tag">Content QA</span>
            <span class="tag">SME Synthesis</span>
            <span class="tag">Iterative Release</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service">
        <div class="service-label">04</div>
        <div class="service-content">
          <h2>FinTech & Financial Services Training</h2>
          <p>Compliance training, financial product onboarding, and regulatory curriculum for teams operating in high-stakes financial environments. Our accounting background and financial domain knowledge means we can work directly from source material without the lengthy SME handholding that general ID agencies require.</p>
          <div class="service-tags">
            <span class="tag">Compliance Training</span>
            <span class="tag">Financial Product Onboarding</span>
            <span class="tag">Regulatory Curriculum</span>
            <span class="tag">Risk & Decision Scenarios</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cta-band">
      <h2>Ready to start a project?</h2>
      <p>Tell us what you're building and we'll scope it together.</p>
      <a href="/agency/work-with-us" class="btn-primary">Work With Us</a>
    </div>

    <footer>
      <span>© 2026 Root Branch Learning Studio</span>
      <span>rootbranchlearning.com</span>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
